        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 446b26c9-f218-4374-ad13-9780a60e0bb5).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. We&apos;ve been hired to take out Ms. Sleiman, a former teacher who&apos;s been reported on numerous occasions for inappropriate conduct with young students. She was particularly forceful with our client&apos;s son, and the case was suspiciously thrown out.\r\rThe other target is the headmaster, who covered up this illegal conduct to protect the school&apos;s reputation. Also on the docket is an officer that interfered with the case for a bribe from the school&apos;s treasury.\r\rMake it hurt, 47.",
